RK05/Unibus Terminator
<UL>
<LI><b>M930</b> is a version of DEC's M930 RK05/Unibus Terminator card using discrete resistors.</LI>
<LI><b>M930C</b> is a version of DEC's M930C RK05/Unibus Terminator card, which uses
DIP resistor packs.</LI>
<LI><b>M930D</b> needs a drawing.</LI>
<LI><b>M930E</b> needs a drawing.</LI>
